> ## tests of offsets, and prediction from them.
> 
> load("anorexia.rda") # copied from package MASS
> 
> ## via formula
> fit1 <- lm(Postwt ~ Prewt + Treat + offset(Prewt), data = anorexia)
> summary(fit1)

Call:
lm(formula = Postwt ~ Prewt + Treat + offset(Prewt), data = anorexia)

